{
    "chapter_num": 12,
    "verses_count": 16,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Dissension of Aaron and Miriam"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Miriam and Aaron "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "criticized"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "spoke against Moses because of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Cushite"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Ethiopian woman whom he had married; for he had married an Ethiopian woman. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So they said, “Has the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " indeed spoken only through Moses? Has He not spoken through us also?” And the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " heard "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "(Now the man Moses "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " very humble, more than all men who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on the face of the earth.)"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Suddenly the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " said to Moses, Aaron, and Miriam, “Come out, you three, to the tabernacle of meeting!” So the three came out. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " came down in the pillar of cloud and stood "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "in"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the door of the tabernacle, and called Aaron and Miriam. And they both went forward. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then He said,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Hear now My words:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If there is a prophet among you,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "I"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", make Myself known to him in a vision;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I speak to him in a dream."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Not so with My servant Moses;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " faithful in all My house."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I speak with him face to face,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Even plainly,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "appearing"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and not in "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "riddles"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "dark sayings;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he sees the form of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Why then were you not afraid"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "To speak against My servant Moses?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So the anger of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " was aroused against them, and He departed. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when the cloud departed from above the tabernacle, suddenly Miriam "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "became"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " leprous, as "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "white as"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " snow. Then Aaron turned toward Miriam, and there she was, a leper. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Aaron said to Moses, “Oh, my lord! Please do not lay "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "the penalty for this"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "this"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " sin on us, in which we have done foolishly and in which we have sinned. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Please do not let her be as one dead, whose flesh is half consumed when he comes out of his mother’s womb!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Moses cried out to the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", saying, “Please heal her, O God, I pray!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " said to Moses, “If her father had but spit in her face, would she not be shamed seven days? Let her be shut"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "exiled"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " out of the camp seven days, and afterward she may be received "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "again."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Miriam was shut out of the camp seven days, and the people did not journey till Miriam was brought in "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "again."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And afterward the people moved from Hazeroth and camped in the Wilderness of Paran."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}